- [0.25ct Natural Marquise in Platinum — $1,430](https://www.bluenile.com/james-allen/item-310947?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

**Who 16" is actually right for:** Buyers with a longer-than-average neck (7"+), buyers who wear mostly turtlenecks and high necklines, buyers who plan to add a 20" chain underneath for layered styling.

### 18 Inches: The Default Sweet Spot

Order 18" if you are unsure. This chain length lands 1–1.5 inches below the collarbone on most adult women. For a marquise pendant, that gap is everything. The stone hangs in open space below the collarbone. The vertical flash creates the elongating effect. The point-up tip aims cleanly at the chest rather than competing with the throat.

This length works with every neckline: V-neck, square, scoop, off-shoulder, crew, button-down. It doesn't fight with collarbone jewelry. It doesn't get swallowed by a deep neckline. It doesn't disappear under turtlenecks.

