- [1.5ct Lab Marquise in 14k White Gold — $1,925](https://www.bluenile.com/james-allen/item-311068?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)
- [2ct Lab Marquise in 14k Yellow Gold — $2,730](https://www.bluenile.com/james-allen/item-311071?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)
